		(property "Description" "KGO: GO. NC contact: Q9 -> PARK (clock inhibit) unless GO.  Chain A: (RUN or an armed step) & not STOP_LATCH & cycle enable (KENK) & not END & not hot.  Chain B: HOMING and not at home.  p2: holds an armed step (KSA) once the ring has been released, so a short tap is not lost"
			(at 485.14 63.5 0)
