		(property "Description" "KHLd: HOMING twin: cycle enable chain is off while HOMING; p2 = flush CLEAR of the HOME pass (window WC -> CLEAR drive while HOMING; the CLEAR relay's own pole 2 holds it to the end of the window).  Decision 0003 4.4: HOME ends with exactly one CLEAR (no STROBE / JUDGE) so that sense relays left latched by an emergency stop are released"
			(at 60.96 218.44 0)
